{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/garland

    A class challenge's garland (Jujol, 13 November): a pennant for each step, coloured when done (coral, sun, green and
    purple in turn), grey while to come; with too many steps, ten, each a tenth. The words beside it say the number.

    Example context (json):
    {"progresslabel": "5 de 6 rincones", "marks": [{"lit": true}, {"lit": true}, {"lit": false}]}
}}
<span class="ayv-bc-guirnalda" role="img" aria-label="{{progresslabel}}">{{#marks}}<span class="ayv-bc-banderin{{#lit}} ayv-bc-banderin-hecho{{/lit}}"></span>{{/marks}}</span>
